				Time="2011-07-12T07:00:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きょううん！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:00:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:00:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ポケモン
・画面？から飛来して待機
・会話するとメッセージ表示とあわせて鳴き声再生
・続けて戦闘に
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:07:03" />
		</CommentCell>
