	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02_sppoke1_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ユクシーは
どこかに　とびさっていった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:02:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:01:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ユクシーは
どこかに　飛び去っていった……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:02:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T07:01:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イベント
・捕獲以外で戦闘終了した場合
・殿堂入りで復帰
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
